# Saudi Plot Platform — root environment template.
#
# There is no root .env: each service reads its own environment file.
# Copy the per-service templates and adjust locally (both copies are
# gitignored — never commit a real .env):
#
#   backend/.env.example   ->  backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example  ->  frontend/.env
#
# Secrets policy:
# - The server-side GEMINI_API_KEY belongs ONLY in backend/.env.
# - The frontend must never receive an AI provider key; it talks only to
#   the backend (VITE_API_BASE_URL).
